#: src/app/(web)/privacy.tsx
msgid "Ride Today does not knowingly collect any personal information from individuals under the age of 13 (or a minor in your jurisdiction) without parental consent. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such data, please contact us so that we can promptly remove the information."
msgstr "Ride Today does not knowingly collect any personal information from individuals under the age of 13 (or a minor in your jurisdiction) without parental consent. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such data, please contact us so that we can promptly remove the information."

#: src/app/(web)/privacy.tsx
msgid "Ride Today only collects your device's location data. No other personal information, such as your name, email, or unique device identifiers, is gathered or processed. Your location data cannot be used to identify you, either by us or by our third-party service providers."
msgstr "Ride Today only collects your device's location data. No other personal information, such as your name, email, or unique device identifiers, is gathered or processed. Your location data cannot be used to identify you, either by us or by our third-party service providers."

