#: src/app/(web)/privacy.tsx
msgid "We implement security measures to help protect your data. Any communication with our weather provider is encrypted using industry-standard protocols (e.g., HTTPS). We take precautions to keep your data secure on your device; however, no security system is completely impenetrable, and we cannot guarantee absolute security of your data."
msgstr "We implement security measures to help protect your data. Any communication with our weather provider is encrypted using industry-standard protocols (e.g., HTTPS). We take precautions to keep your data secure on your device; however, no security system is completely impenetrable, and we cannot guarantee absolute security of your data."

#: src/app/(web)/privacy.tsx
msgid "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices. When we do, we will post the updated policy within the App and update the \"Last Updated\" date at the top of this document. Your continued use of the App following any changes indicates your acknowledgment of the modifications."
msgstr "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices. When we do, we will post the updated policy within the App and update the \"Last Updated\" date at the top of this document. Your continued use of the App following any changes indicates your acknowledgment of the modifications."

#: src/app/(web)/privacy.tsx
msgid "We use your location data solely to fetch relevant weather details from our trusted third-party weather provider. No other data is transmitted to the weather provider. By transmitting only location coordinates—and not any personally identifiable information—you remain anonymous to us and our third-party services."
msgstr "We use your location data solely to fetch relevant weather details from our trusted third-party weather provider. No other data is transmitted to the weather provider. By transmitting only location coordinates—and not any personally identifiable information—you remain anonymous to us and our third-party services."

#: src/modules/modal/modals/RideScoreModal.tsx
msgid "We wish to remind you that the RideScore is an estimation and that the actual quality of the ride may vary. DO NOT rely solely on the RideScore to determine if you should ride or not, always check the weather and the road conditions."
msgstr "We wish to remind you that the RideScore is an estimation and that the actual quality of the ride may vary. DO NOT rely solely on the RideScore to determine if you should ride or not, always check the weather and the road conditions."

#: src/app/(web)/privacy.tsx
msgid "Welcome to Ride Today. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it through our compliance with this policy. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and safeguard your personal information when you use Ride Today (the \"App\")."
msgstr "Welcome to Ride Today. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it through our compliance with this policy. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and safeguard your personal information when you use Ride Today (the \"App\")."

